Dashboard Plus adds nine widgets to the OPNsense dashboard, next to the
built-in ones: System Information+, Traffic Graph+, System Metrics+, Thermal
Sensors+, Interface Statistics+, Gateways+, Interfaces+, Firewall Logs+ and Services+.
They extend the standard widgets with hardware, firmware and CPU security
details, configurable time windows, per-interface colours, field selection
and drag-to-reorder, without modifying the OPNsense core.

The "Dashboard Plus widgets" privilege also allows reading the live firewall
log, gateway status, pf state counts and interface details, and controlling
services from Services+.
